## Interface: 16001
## Title: High Fidelity World Map - Forever Art
## Notes: Required map art for High Fidelity World Map: Forever. Contains the stitched high-resolution World, Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor maps. No settings or UI of its own; install High Fidelity World Map to use it.
## Author: HighFidelityWorldMap
## Version: @project-version@
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Map02
## X-Curse-Project-ID: 1727004

# The tiles under WorldMap\ (the World, Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor maps,
# nothing else) are read by High Fidelity World Map through their file paths,
# so they are not listed here. Zone and cave maps are drawn from the game's own
# minimap tiles and need no art.
#
# FDIDMap.lua (generated; FileDataID -> tile path, plus the HD continent
# layouts) defines plain HFWMF_* globals that the core addon reads at load
# time, after this addon (it RequiredDeps on it).
FDIDMap.lua
